<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Omega lifts interim shr, no div.</title>
<headline>Omega lifts interim shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     11.4	  vs    0.2</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   2.57	  vs    0.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   2.57	  vs    0.05</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   5.84	  vs    2.71</p>
<p>    Turnover		107.92	  vs    67.20</p>
<p>Full name: Omega Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said strong demand for the group's products was expected to continue through the next six months.</p>
<p>It is company policy to declare dividends at the end of a financial.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
